{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "4a5151f1ee5cb6f1deab85d525d5e0ac43528d8496d36d2332030df894e93246", "ja": "今日はCM撮影。皆に衣装が似合っていると\n伝えるプロデューサー。花嫁の気持ちを理解\nするため、結婚式ごっこをしようと提案する\nこのみ。プロデューサーとの模擬結婚式で、\n自分達の目標を再確認する5人だった。", "zh": "今日要拍摄广告。制作人表示大家穿上服装\n都很好看。为了理解新娘的心情，木实提议\n要来玩婚礼游戏。在与制作人的模拟婚礼中，\n五人重新确认了自己的目标。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "4604b45d1271ae5b0f31b3a3a8a5b32288d56454b52f5352e0a020e946796854", "ja": "（いよいよ『ハピマリ』のCM撮影当日だ。チャペルの\n神聖な雰囲気のせいか、少し緊張してきたな……）", "zh": "（终于来到『幸福婚礼』广告拍摄当天了。\n可能是教堂神圣的气氛使然，我开始有点紧张了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1001_null", "source_sha256": "cae3fff4b3bddd5424c9b494cf6bd5f4483d73750844dd306cf86b6e9f03ab5c", "ja": "コツコツコツ……", "zh": "（脚步声）……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "2e92338f1f87eec1145728ad2b25b39033fabf60c3729317240ce0d47d798159", "ja": "お、おまたせしました……。", "zh": "久、久等了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "a7be39b8051744833ac47fa73d841c19b36fa5154518ac89062b041611f287cc", "ja": "ああ、風花。\n着替え、終わったのか。", "zh": "啊，风花。\n你换好衣服了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "450d218088b3520fa60deff99b83fb8a92a82252a843ab6db40c37ba87db078c", "ja": "あ、あの……。似合ってますか……？\n変じゃ、ないですか……？", "zh": "请、请问……好看吗……？\n会不会很奇怪……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1008_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e2fcaddf0fec27098535bd6c5702e9b54586114c030760571a66d1c52192f856", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}さん？\nな、何か、いってくれないと、私……その……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生？\n拜、拜托你说点什么，不然……我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f59964a23dc4a21d28ec2d407e5111aa6d51480addf0c0fb78baaa2affa8a135", "ja": "やっぱり私には、もっと露出の多いセクシーな\n衣装の方がよかったって、そう思ってるんですか！？", "zh": "难道你觉得我果然还是比较适合\n更裸露一点的性感服装吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "6bcbf9dee0a29077ab1bb8807c4bb5fc2788cae2cffa92f421302166482b6b57", "ja": "い、いや違う！　誤解だ！\nその、ただ……。", "zh": "不、不是的！你误会了！\n我只是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_1011", "source_sha256": "1f654794c22ef10b792407c6a5faf4bb45e249bdc21941d84b45170bea245280", "ja": "似合ってる", "zh": "很好看", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2000_p", "source_sha256": "63547773fed2aea438c8f0f0e6b8dde92a725334eb3cad245411c56569b7a580", "ja": "……ごめん。予想以上に似合ってたから、\nちょっと驚いてたんだ。……うん、キレイだよ。", "zh": "……抱歉，因为比想像中更好看，\n我看傻了……嗯，很漂亮喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "87f62f08606149069e3e71287eff2aca6273463a196216e18824178f96e6894b", "ja": "……っ。そ、そうですか……うれしい……。\nあっ、あの、よかったです♪", "zh": "是、是吗……好高兴……\n啊！那个，太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2002_046rio", "source_sha256": "1c525612ed18acf9f727d37444a0c64d7b53ba38304adb5a111d5896e1dd3609", "ja": "もう、ズルいじゃない{$P$}くん！\nふたりだけで初々しいカップルごっこして～！", "zh": "唉唷，很狡猾耶，{$P$}！\n就你们两人在那边扮演青涩小情侣～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2003_052kao", "source_sha256": "e9ee5b5ef2b8d13c38a50a05fd9875962942fd4010f0e6ff39b9e1920d9a342f", "ja": "その……。私たちはどうですか、\n{$P$}さん？", "zh": "那个……我们看起来怎么样呢，\n{$P$}先生？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2004_p", "source_sha256": "66ca897ab30c2f9e3a866fb30fff20d819c60f13816f31f70af9c2fe1e937ac1", "ja": "そ、そうですね。莉緒はなんだか、普段とギャップも\nあるせいか、清楚な印象がすごく鮮烈で……。", "zh": "这、这个嘛，莉绪可能也是\n跟平常的形象有反差，总觉得好清纯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2005_p", "source_sha256": "7dae72f79427921e904dd03805132124bbb893ed12fe5bce73f97da727411e08", "ja": "歌織さんは、いつもの上品で優しい雰囲気が倍になった\n感じで。ふたりとも魅力的で、とってもまぶしいです。", "zh": "歌织小姐则是更衬托出平时知性柔美的气质。\n两个人都很有魅力，非常耀眼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2006_046rio", "source_sha256": "a30a7b3dcd7448bedc0f8a56b0df7fbeaf46178fb433eb26427d2ae972673883", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがと♪\nいまのホメ言葉、悪くなかったわよ♪", "zh": "呵呵！谢谢♪\n刚才那句赞美不错喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2007_052kao", "source_sha256": "59d1006da04048c576745911f1c49a5546381638f0b58e658573e2030bda91cf", "ja": "私も……そう言ってもらえて嬉しいです。\n撮影にも、自信を持って臨めそうです♪", "zh": "我也是……很高兴听到你这么说。\n感觉我可以更有自信去拍摄了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2008_038chz", "source_sha256": "bad8355e6ff7064b1aa3f682b5168c7b62f587f2f7dfe5c379256e0f0dbfd36f", "ja": "{$P$}、お待たせいたしましたわ。", "zh": "{$P$}，让你久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2009_039kon", "source_sha256": "1b61a03022739bfa224ece8577e20d2a59749dc64a6f3bbb5b77fe050c736d36", "ja": "これで全員準備完了ね！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "这样就全员都准备完成啦！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2010_p", "source_sha256": "923ed38db3bc858e280ada203090c7f52b49f38be9b9f9384a57d9e802d2312d", "ja": "……千鶴さん、さすがですね。ウェディングドレス姿\nだと、いつも以上にエレガントです！", "zh": "……真不愧是千鹤，\n穿上婚纱比平时更优雅了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2011_038chz", "source_sha256": "6f13e10d5fe30948325890890fb47278eba2b9f7d854eb2e0b25c1d0e6b06baa", "ja": "ふふっ、ありがとうございますわ。ですがウェディング\nドレスを着こなすのも、セレブのたしなみですの！", "zh": "呵呵！谢谢。\n不过能驾驭婚纱，也是名流应有的素养！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2012_038chz", "source_sha256": "a6add2d911b4a13a972250dfa019d971740a75e84946c5de1ae7a58681f99c5f", "ja": "ただ……この衣装もずいぶんと高級そうですのね？\n万が一にも汚したりしないよう、気をつけないと……。", "zh": "只是……这件服装应该相当高级吧？\n我要小心才行，可千万不能弄脏了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2013_p", "source_sha256": "bef6f9460eb374145efe438a00eb7318ac50900c7ce93ee3e9c6c4e2340240f5", "ja": "そして、このみさんも……似合ってます。花嫁として、\nとても大切にしたくなる……そんな着こなしですね。", "zh": "然后木实……也很好看。\n是会让人想要捧在手心呵护的那种新娘……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2014_039kon", "source_sha256": "beed29f801cad727974ad108e69121d2e5cfd6c2aac3036cf5068358949e21f5", "ja": "そうなのよ。私が着ると、ウェディングドレスですら\nアダルティに着こなしてしまうの！　困っちゃうわ～。", "zh": "没错，只要由我来穿，\n连婚纱都可以穿出成熟魅力！真伤脑筋呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2016_p", "source_sha256": "ddc76722965ada209778ba722ad3f41783f88a24d61d0a3429b350d7a724d0bc", "ja": "……おっと。もうすぐ撮影開始ですね。それじゃ、\n何か気になってることとかはありませんか？", "zh": "……哦，快要开始拍摄了呢。\n那大家还有没有什么问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2017_052kao", "source_sha256": "b614637c69c3d580f2c8f72c745f0d6c4d347260e6dd49d68988ce99b387c276", "ja": "あの……実はひとつあるんです。今回のCM撮影、\nやっぱり花嫁の気持ちになることが大切、ですよね。", "zh": "那个……其实我有个问题。\n这次拍摄广告，有当新娘的心情果然很重要对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2018_052kao", "source_sha256": "6ace21a511be9724c9d5184d43c52ba50ce5a302c0142cb2c74f66bf12b0f04d", "ja": "でも私たちは、本当に結婚するわけじゃありません。\nですから、花嫁の気持ちになれているかというと……。", "zh": "但我们并不是真的要结婚。\n所以，要说有没有当新娘的心情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2019_p", "source_sha256": "8576db3e1584ca47f5854e30616b5d59fe8649f010670e9167bebea1db288f2d", "ja": "……不安がある、ということですね。うーん、\nでも本当に結婚してもらうわけにいかないし……。", "zh": "所以这部分让你觉得不放心啰……\n嗯……但是又不可能真的要你们结婚……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2020_039kon", "source_sha256": "e69fc778adb7d5b49485484f9f41da32889b2d3d8ff8d7012ed10d11358d4619", "ja": "それがね。さっきからみんなにも相談してるんだけど、\n今ここで、結婚式を挙げてみようと思ってるの。", "zh": "关于这个，其实刚才我也在跟大家讨论，\n我打算现在就在这里举行一个婚礼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2021_039kon", "source_sha256": "1f2c4b39870212821901e2ee5dd1363ac6003102d69594c872a6544a01672eaa", "ja": "というわけで、{$P$}。\nちょっと、私たちの結婚相手になってくれないかしら？", "zh": "所以啦，{$P$}。\n可以请你当一下我们的结婚对象吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2022_p", "source_sha256": "0a456c5a0735f43bb724b1ffbe2af6097abe15216791bfa20da5f8d5675f170f", "ja": "なるほど、みんなの結婚相手……", "zh": "原来如此，由我来当大家的结婚对象……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_2023", "source_sha256": "236422b579b81ec7ca4412a47313fcc87320d448217a22675add3f2947543bc2", "ja": "えええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3000_p", "source_sha256": "236422b579b81ec7ca4412a47313fcc87320d448217a22675add3f2947543bc2", "ja": "えええっ！？", "zh": "咦咦咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3001_046rio", "source_sha256": "4f75b14969fbf14701038d8ca3ec4c419bf282174f9127b45adca2127935b93a", "ja": "ふふっ。もちろん、ごっこよ。結婚式ごっこ♪\nお芝居とか、おママゴトみたいなモノだってば！", "zh": "呵呵！当然是玩游戏啦，婚礼游戏♪\n就像演戏或扮家家酒那样的东西！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "94ba406cd4ece79d041ad1aa5a9bd98f994f43b147d8a749af74735e3e2606f1", "ja": "わ、私はやっぱり、まだ恥ずかしいんですけど……。\nだって、誓いの言葉とか、そんな……！", "zh": "我、我还是觉得很难为情……\n因为还要说什么誓言，实在太……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3003_039kon", "source_sha256": "f171455c895acccf79cc29c6c29dad30959d106302394a2f9f2141e600faa823", "ja": "大丈夫、大丈夫、減るもんじゃないし！\nそれに、みんなでいいCMにするため！　でしょ？", "zh": "没关系啦，又不会少块肉！\n而且这是为了让我们拍出很棒的广告，不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3004_052kao", "source_sha256": "925c300d6d38c08c33372093638efa874fc51d275e6390a88cd6de4c504b770c", "ja": "……そうですよね。お仕事のためですもの。\n私……。歌織は、結婚します！", "zh": "……说得也是，都是为了工作嘛。\n我……歌织要结婚了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3005_p", "source_sha256": "4a20a06c7f7a0d2b32eb678f888820c51c84697a8fc0a401b3f249498ab519f1", "ja": "か、歌織さん、落ち着いて下さい！", "zh": "歌、歌织小姐，你冷静一点！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3006_038chz", "source_sha256": "340478c59ba62fdd070e67cff44d299520d83ef5e747ca8ab7e909b84b0c804d", "ja": "歌織さん、乗り気でしたのね……。とはいえ、\n偽りの誓いの言葉では、お稽古になりませんわ。", "zh": "歌织兴致很高呢……话虽如此，\n如果用假的誓言就不算练习了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3007_038chz", "source_sha256": "98102d60190ae947fc99fd52edf4efcfc0f890dbdd9f0f898cdefb7c7a11c55f", "ja": "わたくし達はアイドル……。ここはアイドルとして、\n真実の誓いの言葉を口にしませんこと？", "zh": "本小姐我们是偶像……\n要不要以偶像身分宣读真正的誓言？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3008_039kon", "source_sha256": "6f7689df6c98d4ad018c58ae0ec8da2c4fee9bebdf0ac58ffb486b5ea53975d1", "ja": "いいアイディア！　さすが千鶴ちゃんね。", "zh": "好主意！不愧是千鹤呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3009_046rio", "source_sha256": "a59285357276fc9c2d5283feaba96bc8610d5a3a4f1965241b880fbabaf31bb4", "ja": "じゃ、そういうことで～。\n時間もないし、ちゃっちゃと始めましょうか♪", "zh": "那就这么决定了～\n时间也不多了，我们快点开始吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3010_041fuk", "source_sha256": "d26c70572193343a91916ce7857f070add80d7ddbff03f815a384a6410ef99ea", "ja": "うう、わかりました。私も覚悟を決めて……。\n{$P$}さん、お願いしますね。", "zh": "呜呜，好吧，我也要下定决心……\n{$P$}先生，拜托你了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3011_p", "source_sha256": "c6d81582df29b7037b9ee859aa39bc021f0a052b4392315e440f4799f71f5941", "ja": "ま、待て待て、お願いされても……！", "zh": "慢、慢着慢着，一定要这样吗……！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3012_046rio", "source_sha256": "f951bb92de0bf695275cdac619265c1dc82af9a46b984e45ab2d57d55af4e061", "ja": "往生際が悪いわよ！　{$P$}くんの\nせいで、微妙なCMになっちゃってもいいの？", "zh": "你很不干脆耶！难道要因为{$P$}\n的关系，害我们广告拍得不好也无所谓吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3013_p", "source_sha256": "b5d6e3e1dbe6429df26fe19971b3bc6ca373f9655d744f71cf36c6b5f3486a89", "ja": "う……。わ、わかったよ。やるけど……\nそのかわり、最高のCMにしてくれよ！", "zh": "唔……知、知道了啦，我当就是了……\n但你们可要拍出最棒的广告喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3014_039kon", "source_sha256": "d994d79d792b469a850350569aa42510acf16e26c0da8a49076012c317663a4a", "ja": "ふふっ、任せてちょうだい♪　\nそれじゃあ……みんな！　私から順番に、ね！", "zh": "呵呵！交给我们吧♪\n那么……各位！从我开始喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3015_039kon", "source_sha256": "e264ff7ef47bbeb53e84ca65abaad66d7998952db5ab1da2e01234b86bf4b2c2", "ja": "病める時も、健やかなる時も。", "zh": "无论疾病或健康。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3016_052kao", "source_sha256": "bcafd773fc51c24538eaabefaa84af4a4bce5bae9214f579f409ed374c407df1", "ja": "喜びの時も、悲しみの時も。", "zh": "快乐或忧愁。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3017_038chz", "source_sha256": "5c7fed29a11b7d0dea4fa5a4d0da42d78ddd474ab838e999d166614351c1e457", "ja": "富める時も、貧しき時も。", "zh": "富有或贫穷。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3018_041fuk", "source_sha256": "211106bbef45a99b8ba7698a1de1ba7ec8c6a96ec56321c0109158924a9bee21", "ja": "これを愛し、これを慰め。", "zh": "都愿意爱你、安慰你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3019_046rio", "source_sha256": "78af0587b1d4f04073668d7550cc87e6f4c2646f9bac65700e49436b5f28dd06", "ja": "これを助け、その命ある限り……。", "zh": "用一生扶持你……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3020_039kon", "source_sha256": "a799125192353afcde7da557268bfc85ac0a33d2e20256dd7cec90b2f319fd15", "ja": "……トップアイドルを目指すことを、誓いますか！", "zh": "……你愿意发誓成为顶尖偶像吗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
