{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3031_p", "source_sha256": "3496808c9b8e4e771fcfea6238d4fb10a1f5afc1ac44fe33aab18fa1e2514b8a", "ja": "（チャペルに響いた花嫁たちの誓いの言葉は、\n間違いなくアイドルの決意……）", "zh": "（在教堂中回荡着新娘们的誓言──\n毫无疑问地是在讲当偶像的决心……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0091_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0091_story_05_3032_p", "source_sha256": "4e16dd23aabfec74c30c5000b9586e9c3c7d29ad9a843a1f1f40a585d6252fd7", "ja": "（なら相手役も、しっかりと口にしないとな。\n彼女達と共に歩む者の、誓いの言葉を！）", "zh": "（那么身为搭档，我也要认真宣读才行──\n宣读与她们并肩前进之人的誓言！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
